   "stem": {
      "text": "Suppose \\( \\int_{1}^{3} f(x)\\,dx = 5 \\) and \\( \\int_{1}^{7} f(x)\\,dx = -11 \\). The function h is defined by \\( h(x) = 4 \\) for \\( x < 4 \\) and \\( h(x) = -4 \\) for \\( x \\ge 4 \\). Find \\( \\int_{3}^{7} \\left(3f(x) + h(x)\\right)\\,dx \\).",
      "command_verb": "find"
   },
